# Pinned SHA256 checksums for staged model files.
#
# Format: one entry per line, "<sha256-hex>  <key>". Lines starting with
# `#` are comments. Empty lines OK.
#
# Keys are of the form "<hf-repo>/<filename>". Entries below are
# placeholders — the operator fills them in after the first verified
# download. Until pinned, stage-models.sh emits a
# `StageModelsChecksumUnpinned` warning and accepts the file.
#
